   "fen": "r1b2rk1/pp1pppbp/2n3p1/3Nn1B1/2B1P3/q7/P1P1NPPP/1R1Q1RK1 w - - 4 13",
   "line": [
    "Nge5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight comes back from its loose post on g4 to the fine central square e5, hitting the c4-bishop as it arrives — its job on g4 is done, and e5 is a much sturdier home.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Reroute a knight that has done its job before it becomes a target — g4 to e5 with tempo.",
   "plans": "Consolidate the centre, then untangle the queenside."
  },
  {
